pr 30 (core Nov-Mar)","shoulder":"May & Sep-early Oct (sea lions open, whale sharks bookending, warm water, softer rates)","green":"Jun-Aug (summer heat, hurricane window, whale sharks gone, sea-lion colony closed Jun 1-Aug 31)","booking_window_lead_time":"3-6 months for Nov-Apr peak; small boutique inventory (Baja Club 32 rooms, Camp Cecil 8 tents Nov-Apr); book whale-shark/Espiritu Santo tours ahead in Oct-Apr","out_of_season_fill_the_beds":"Balandra/Tecolote beaches, San Rafaelito reef (sea-lion substitute during closure), Malecon dining + sunset sails, Salvatierra wreck diving, boutique summer value rates","holiday_event_peaks":"Christmas-New Year, Semana Santa (Easter), whale-shark core Nov-Mar; domestic spikes Easter + mid-summer","campaign_start_trigger":"whale-shark/Espiritu Santo campaigns May-Jul (4-6 months ahead of Oct opening); Nov-Apr honeymoon/beach campaigns late summer; summer green-window value in spring","flag":"whale shark dead May-Sep; sea lions closed Jun 1-Aug 31; summer overlaps hurricane season Jun-Nov","sources":["https://www.thoroughlytravel.com/swim-with-whale-sharks-la-paz/","https://www.goworldtravel.com/snorkeling-sea-lions-sea-of-cortez/","https://scubaboard.com/community/threads/la-paz-sea-lion-colony-closed-for-snorkel-scuba-june-1-aug-31.621077/","https://www.islands.com/story/resorts/the-glamping-experience-of-isla-espiritu-santo-camp-cecil/"]},"jewels":[{"name":"Whale-shark snorkel, Bay of La Paz","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","tier":"comfort","bookable":"licensed operator half-day snorkel (Oct 1-Apr 30)","source":"https://www.thoroughlytravel.com/swim-with-whale-sharks-la-paz/","hook":"eye-to-eye with juvenile whale sharks in a controlled, no-touch refuge encounter","si":"expedition","blurb":"eye-to-eye with juvenile whale sharks in a controlled, no-touch refuge encounter","commission":"local operator + Journey Mexico/Amstar DMC + Viator affiliate"},{"name":"Los Islotes sea-lion snorkel","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","tier":"comfort","bookable":"Espiritu Santo day tour (Sep-May)","source":"https://www.goworldtravel.com/snorkeling-sea-lions-sea-of-cortez/","hook":"play with 600+ California sea lions at one of Mexico''s healthiest colonies","si":"expedition","blurb":"play with 600+ California sea lions at one of Mexico''s healthiest colonies","commission":"local operator + DMC + Viator affiliate"},{"name":"Espiritu Santo full-day island + snorkel","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","tier":"premier","bookable":"permitted day tour incl. CONANP bracelet","source":"https://www.thoroughlytravel.com/isla-espiritu-santo/","hook":"uninhabited UNESCO desert island — beaches, sea lions, snorkel","si":"expedition","blurb":"uninhabited UNESCO desert island — beaches, sea lions, snorkel","commission":"local operator + DMC"},{"name":"Playa Balandra day trip (El Hongo)","si_tag":"Tropical Islands","status":"live","tier":"essential","bookable":"transfer/tour or self-drive + CONANP bracelet","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puerto_Balandra,_Baja_California_Sur","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Mexico''s most photographed beach, shallow turquoise flats, protected","si":"tropical","blurb":"Mexico''s most photographed beach, shallow turquoise flats, protected","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"DMC transfer + GYG affiliate"},{"name":"Malecon + sunset sail","si_tag":"Tropical Islands","status":"live","tier":"premier","bookable":"catamaran/sail charter","source":"https://www.thoroughlytravel.com/swim-with-whale-sharks-la-paz/","hook":"La Paz''s waterfront promenade and calm-bay sunset cruises","si":"tropical","blurb":"La Paz''s waterfront promenade and calm-bay sunset cruises","commission":"charter operator + Viator affiliate"},{"name":"Salvatierra wreck dive","si_tag":"Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures","status":"future","tier":"comfort","bookable":"dive-within-cert charter","source":"https://lapazdivers.com/la-paz-dive-sites/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"1976 ferry wreck at 18–20 m, thriving artificial reef, diveable near year-round","si":"Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures","blurb":"1976 ferry wreck at 18–20 m, thriving artificial reef, diveable near year-round","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"dive operator + affiliate"}],"faq":[{"q":"When and how can I swim with whale sharks in La Paz?","a":"October 1 to April 30, on a licensed half-day snorkel in the bay''s protected refuge zone — never scuba. Encounters are capped at 5 swimmers plus a certified guide per shark for 30 minutes, with no touching, to protect the juveniles that feed there.","source":"thoroughlytravel.com / bucketlistbri.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Is La Paz a good island and beach base?","a":"Yes — it is the launch port for the whole Sea-of-Cortez set: protected Balandra, Tecolote, the Malecón waterfront and boat trips to UNESCO-listed Espíritu Santo. It''s the quiet, low-key alternative to the Los Cabos corridor two hours south.","source":"en.wikipedia.org, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"What is there to dive around La Paz?","a":"The signature dive is the Salvatierra, a 1976 ferry wreck at 18–20 m that''s now a thriving artificial reef, diveable near year-round, plus the El Bajo seamount. La Paz has its own recompression chamber (confirm status at booking) and DAN emergency is +1-919-684-9111.","source":"lapazdivers.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Missing the season, not crime. Whale sharks are gone May–Sep, sea lions close Jun 1–Aug 31, both are snorkel-only (no touch, no scuba), and hurricane season runs Jun–Nov. Book the Oct–Apr window ahead and carry trip insurance for summer/fall.","source":"scubaboard.com / dossier Safety Card, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"La Paz Whale Sharks & Sea Lions: Sea of Cortez Guide","meta_description":"Snorkel with whale sharks (Oct–Apr) and sea lions at Los Islotes, then sail to UNESCO-listed Espíritu Santo — the quiet Baja capital on the Sea of Cortez. When and how to book.","slug":"la-paz-mexico","primary_keyword":"La Paz whale sharks","long_tail":["La Paz whale shark season 2026","swim with sea lions Los Islotes","Espiritu Santo tour from La Paz","Balandra beach La Paz guide","La Paz Sea of Cortez snorkel"],"search_language":["en","es-MX"],"local_keywords":["tiburón ballena La Paz temporada","nadar con lobos marinos Los Islotes","tour Isla Espíritu Santo desde La Paz","Playa Balandra La Paz","snorkel Mar de Cortés La Paz","hoteles boutique La Paz Baja","buceo naufragio Salvatierra"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-04"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"expedition","status":"live"},{"si":"tropical","status":"live"},{"si":"Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Baja Club","posture":"boutique-luxe, Design Hotels/Marriott (not full branded ultra)","price_tier":"luxury","earning":"on application / host-Virtuoso or Marriott STARS/Design Hotels program","virtuoso_value_add":"amenity block (breakfast/credit/upgrade) where rate qualifies","mor":"commissionable only where offered; no net-rate resale","source":"https://www.designhotels.com/hotels/mexico/baja-california-sur/la-paz/baja-club/"},{"name":"CostaBaja Resort & Spa (Puerta Cortes)","posture":"five-star resort (La Paz first five-star)","price_tier":"luxury","earning":"on application / host bedbank or preferred program","virtuoso_value_add":"amenity block where rate qualifies","mor":"no net-rate resale","source":"https://www.costabajaresortspa.com/"},{"name":"Camp Cecil de la Isla (Espiritu Santo)","posture":"eco-luxe private-island glamping (8 tents, TOSEA)","price_tier":"ultra","earning":"on application / host-Virtuoso or TOSEA operator terms","virtuoso_value_add":"private buy-out / naturalist upgrade on application","mor":"no net-rate resale","source":"https://www.islands.com/story/resorts/the-glamping-experience-of-isla-espiritu-santo-camp-cecil/"},{"name":"Puerta Cortes private beachfront villa (private pool/jacuzzi)","posture":"top private villa in gated marina-golf community","price_tier":"luxury","earning":"on application / villa-manager commission where offered; often OTA/Airbnb (affiliate)","virtuoso_value_add":"concierge + beach-club access","mor":"no net-rate resale","source":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/mx/beachfront-villa-private-pool-at-puerta-cortes.html"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-04","hero":{"query":"La Paz, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":24.1425,"lng":-110.3108}}'::jsonb, 19),
